note: Capability Registry enforcement core (lawful pure-function subset; install/update/remove lifecycle awaits runtime tape - "安装入带" cannot be staged shell-side). Delivered: CapabilityManifest.swift (schema-mirror Codable, vendor_tier doc = identity attestation not quality); ManifestValidator.swift (required[] loaded from the REAL contracts/capability_manifest.schema.json at init - single source of truth, no drifting duplicate list, test asserts set equality); FailClosedClassifier.swift (whitepaper §13.8 / §7.3 node 16 / non-negotiable 19 mechanized: missing/invalid action_classes -> treatAsClass3, unparseable -> deny, escalation node outside 1..8 -> deny, class_3 minimum signature node 4 encoded as SignatureNode.class3Minimum); Disposition = exactly {classified, treatAsClass3, deny} with compile-level exhaustiveness test. 3 hostile negative fixtures in fixtures/capability_negative/ (kept out of contracts validator glob). Verifier independently constructed hostile manifests and traced code paths (action_classes absent -> treatAsClass3; garbage escalation node 0 -> deny - never permissive). 99 tests (+8), MIN_TESTS 91->99, app lane x2 + validate_contracts both green, verifier 7/7 PASS 0 blockers. shipgate p1 16/16 PASS.
